  {
    "id" : "asyncapi-operation-operationId-uniqueness",
    "level" : "High",
    "category" : "ErrorProne",
    "subCategory" : null,
    "title" : "Enforce Unique operationId Across All Operations",
    "description" : "Ensures that the \"operationId\" value is unique across all operations in an AsyncAPI document, except those defined in components.",
    "explanation" : "# asyncapi-operation-operationId-uniqueness\n\n`operationId` must be unique across all the operations (except the ones defined in the components).\n\n**Recommended:** Yes\n\n**Bad Example**\n\n```yaml\nchannels:\n  smartylighting.streetlights.1.0.action.{streetlightId}.turn.on:\n    publish:\n      operationId: turn\n  smartylighting.streetlights.1.0.action.{streetlightId}.turn.off:\n    publish:\n      operationId: turn\n```\n\n**Good Example**\n\n```yaml\nchannels:\n  smartylighting.streetlights.1.0.action.{streetlightId}.turn.on:\n    publish:\n      operationId: turnOn\n  smartylighting.streetlights.1.0.action.{streetlightId}.turn.off:\n    publish:\n      operationId: turnOff\n```",
    "enabled" : true,
