    "id" : "oas3_1-callbacks-in-webhook",
    "level" : "Warning",
    "category" : "BestPractice",
    "subCategory" : null,
    "title" : "Disallow Callbacks in Webhook",
    "description" : "This rule ensures that callbacks are not defined inside webhook objects in an OpenAPI 3.1 specification.",
    "explanation" : "# oas3_1-callbacks-in-webhook\n\nCallbacks should not be defined in a webhook.\n\n**Recommended:** Yes\n\n**Bad Example**\n\n```yaml\nwebhooks:\n  newPet:\n    post:\n      callbacks: ...\n```",
    "enabled" : true,
